{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50894","headline":"赠彭蟾处士 · 王贞白","name":"赠彭蟾处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不阻兵散乱，穿杨已叠双。\n文深李北海，诗净贾长江。\n退隐斸山药，醉眠凭酒缸。\n年年搜草泽，未便老书窗。\n（案彭蟾字东蟾，好学不仕，《全唐诗》卷五百四十六收彭蟾诗一首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}